Provider-specific image API guidance for OpenAI:
- If reference images are attached, they are passed through the Images edit endpoint. Use style
  references for visual identity and source references for source-specific shape/content, but do not
  copy irrelevant sheet elements into the card.
- OpenAI generally follows detailed visual direction well; preserve the full card-specific brief,
  but keep final visible text sparse and large.
- When the reference set includes character/design sheets, reuse the palette, rendering finish,
  rounded training-poster shapes, and approved character geometry only when appropriate for the
  studied fact.
